  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your devastating blows can literally tear your target apart.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Savage Critical<sup>CAF</sup>, 5th mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you confirm a critical hit, your target takes 1 point of Strength or Dexterity damage (50% chance of either). If you expend one use of mythic power, you may select whether the target takes Strength or Dexterity damage, and you deal a number of points of ability damage equal to your critical multiplier. A mythic creature can attempt a Fortitude save against a DC of 10 + your base attack bonus + your mythic tier to reduce this ability damage by half (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
